Store container image updates reported by Diun

New pihub/updates.py with an Updates store: one entry per image from Diun
webhook bodies with status "update" ("new" is Diun's first sighting and is
ignored). Same digest keeps the first received time and merges container
names; a new digest replaces the entry. Saved atomically to a 0600 file; a
missing or corrupt file starts empty; at most 200 entries, oldest dropped.
Non-http(s) hub links are dropped so they can't become javascript: links.

Files: pihub/updates.py, tests/test_updates.py,
tests/fixtures/diun_webhook.json (two real Diun v4.33.1 bodies), .gitignore
